  "id": "separation-distress",
  "term": "separation distress",
  "definition": "Separation distress is the part of homesickness that involves feeling the absence of home and close relationships, such as missing family and friends or longing for home. In this context, it is distinguished from difficulties adjusting to a new situation.",
